From 289cdfea79d40ad950c895264719392c90aedd09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:30:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(post): post explicit sinker side burns through
 machine dialect data

Require a complete lateral servo template before a Side Burn section.
Preserve downward entry and explicit lateral endpoints in document units.
Refuse unsupported motion and incomplete machine data by name.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3001
---
